# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Ported from netlify.toml. Order matters: first match wins.

# Vanity short links for a resume or email signature.
/resume    /resume.pdf                        302
/linkedin  https://www.linkedin.com/in/mdonn  302

# NOTE: no `/* /index.html 200` catch-all here.
# Netlify needs that line for SPA fallback. Cloudflare Pages rejects it
# (error 100324, infinite loop) because Pages already strips `.html` and
# `/index` itself, so the rule re-triggers on its own output.
# Not needed regardless: navigation on this site is hash-based, so only
# `/`, `/resume.pdf` and `/assets/*` ever reach the server.
